{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061037/block/singleImage/3252664/df/01M63QVHY9JS030J67SYWGXA21.jpg?updatedAt=1793274862\"/><p>出外遊玩最怕討厭的蚊蟲打擾！「日本叮叮®全效驅蚊防蟲噴霧」絕對是必備旅伴。日本叮叮®特別選用天然檸檬桉油及原創防叮配方Cipeller®，蘊含天然PMD驅蚊成分。PMD獲美國疾病控制與預防中心(CDC)及美國國家環境保護局(EPA)等多國權威機構認可，能強效驅走蚊、蠓、蚋、蜱及蠅等多種常見害蟲。配方不含避蚊胺(DEET)與樟腦，性質溫和安全。銷售點 : 部份大型連鎖零售商、藥房藥行、網上平台及國內電商平台有售，詳情可致電(852) 2787 0066 查詢。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:41:21.955574+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:43.701467+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:19.681196+00:00","content_hash":"0a849ef2837a04893e48bb772646615477913959dd1b7b162f2563bbdbbc396b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:41:21.955574+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}